## Title: Eyes Up
## Notes: Watch the world, not the minimap. A quiet cue when something worth stopping for is near.
## Author: KTM (abitofmoss)
## Version: 1.2.4
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: EyesUpDB
## SavedVariables: EyesUpAccountDB
## IconTexture: Interface\ICONS\INV_Misc_Herb_16
## X-Category: Map & Minimap
